%% Protocol Buffers Plugin Protocol
%% Commit: ea940efd2c20e4e8b6509153a703175a51e66749

sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant Protoc as protoc
    participant Plugin as protoc-gen-xxx

    User->>Protoc: protoc --xxx_out=. input.proto

    Note over Protoc: Parse input.proto
    Note over Protoc: Build descriptor tree

    Protoc->>Protoc: Find protoc-gen-xxx in PATH
    Protoc->>Plugin: Spawn process

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Protoc,Plugin: CodeGeneratorRequest (via stdin)
        Protoc->>Plugin: file_to_generate: ["input.proto"]
        Protoc->>Plugin: proto_file: [FileDescriptorProto...]
        Protoc->>Plugin: parameter: "option1=value1"
    end

    Note over Plugin: Generate code from descriptors

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Plugin,Protoc: CodeGeneratorResponse (via stdout)
        Plugin->>Protoc: file: [{name: "input.xxx", content: "..."}]
        Plugin->>Protoc: supported_features: EDITIONS
    end

    Protoc->>Protoc: Write generated files
    Protoc->>User: Success

    Note over User,Plugin: Error Handling

    alt Parse Error
        Plugin->>Protoc: error: "Invalid input"
        Protoc->>User: Error message
    else Success
        Protoc->>User: Generated files
    end
